{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside the computer and join forces with your friend in <strong>Bytebond</strong>, an exhilarating co-op adventure where teamwork is the ultimate weapon. Explore multiple biomes, each teeming with new foes and mind-bending puzzles. Using your unique energy management abilities, collaborate with a friend in an online or classic split-screen environment.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/910cbe4eb606792c70f2eff2cfc9f9b6.poster.avif?t=1766494177\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/910cbe4eb606792c70f2eff2cfc9f9b6.webm?t=1766494177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/910cbe4eb606792c70f2eff2cfc9f9b6.mp4?t=1766494177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/a849241e4cd57aa5fd9fd7e1d70f7fe5.avif?t=1766494177\" width=616 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Co-op Gameplay:</strong> Players collaborate to achieve common goals and overcome challenges together. Join forces to charge and convert energy, powering machines and solving puzzles to progress through levels. Don't have someone by your side? No worries; single-player mode is available too!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Challenges:</strong> Compete against a range of digital foes and virus bots while navigating difficult puzzles that need seamless teamwork and strategy. Adapt your techniques to defeat each individual adversary.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/601ecb60877539e5f9c4c57cd75dee69.poster.avif?t=1766494177\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/601ecb60877539e5f9c4c57cd75dee69.webm?t=1766494177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/601ecb60877539e5f9c4c57cd75dee69.mp4?t=1766494177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/f0e4e3addba857e44af1f38d523a3be2.avif?t=1766494177\" width=616 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Biomes</strong> - Traverse through different computer components, from the neon-lit circuits of the motherboard to the intricate pathways of the CPU. Each biome brings its unique set of enemies and puzzle challenges, keeping you on your toes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Antivirus Special Forces</strong> - Engage on an operation unlike any other, where fast thinking and teamwork are critical to victory. You are not only a special unit... but also cute chubby droids!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Co-op Experience</strong> - Whether you prefer online play or classic split-screen, Bytebond offers a seamless experience with a controller support steering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/d3c283728145d98db57e6463e1598e54.poster.avif?t=1766494177\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/d3c283728145d98db57e6463e1598e54.webm?t=1766494177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/d3c283728145d98db57e6463e1598e54.mp4?t=1766494177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Energy Bond","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1952690/eb68eff2f784da84bc95f4568e8b5ae552436d6d.jpg"},{"name":"Power Spam","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1952690/b917e1ee99e0d50307efd6d51790b4a311566808.jpg"},{"name":"Betrayal Protocol","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1952690/6eedec81705011c093b59560e614cd9377527aae.jpg"},{"name":"Support Failure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1952690/13146eea1310f4c53ba6eed6aea8cae1ad358f77.jpg"},{"name":"Virus Cleaner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1952690/9ae38f61093cafa72bab2eb5a6cefde272dffad0.jpg"},{"name":"Double Kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1952690/ecd911104b13d273cdf181e76205fb5b9aaedc68.jpg"},{"name":"Power Play","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1952690/1f7fd6b0250152038b403c3d878eacb2c13c3390.jpg"},{"name":"Snowman Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1952690/82dfd90e40a0fbe2583ee6108d0ab8cfdd93c43a.jpg"},{"name":"System Sweep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1952690/562e1c2726419fa5702d1f1c105436fdfaa3d1cd.jpg"},{"name":"Untouchable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1952690/cb3e50d9ff05c9784b56918e4433c97b61b0db7f.jpg"}],"total":29},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1952690?t=1766494177","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766494177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/2476b3e9be06c51c2f6e9d1a1fb67d25111b8db6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766494177","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/2476b3e9be06c51c2f6e9d1a1fb67d25111b8db6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766494177","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2818740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>CORE FEATURES</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/6523b21339d22be98cb271bf6b32664f.avif?t=1766494177\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u26a1\u00a0<strong>Team up and power through</strong> \u2013 Master energy management skills to charge machines, activate hidden systems, and unlock paths. Coordinate with your partner to solve puzzles that require perfect timing and cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83e\udd16\u00a0<strong>Battle virus bots </strong>\u2013 Use teamwork and clever tactics to outmaneuver and delete them before they overrun the system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10\u00a0<strong>Explore a digital world </strong>\u2013 Journey through glowing neon circuits, vast CPU corridors, and strange \u201cdata biomes\u201d that feel alive. Each area hides secrets, shortcuts, and unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udfae\u00a0<strong>Play your way </strong>\u2013 Swap effortlessly between online co-op, split-screen with friends, or solo play. No matter how you choose, the experience stays fast-paced, fun, and accessible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Join the Antivirus Special Forces</strong> \u2013 Control adorable yet powerful droids on a mission to save the system</p></p><br><h1>SUPPORTER EDITION</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/816401d36e8db4c788a7160272e0e4de.avif?t=1766494177\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside the computer and join forces with your friend in <strong>Bytebond</strong>, an exhilarating co-op adventure where teamwork is the ultimate weapon. Explore multiple biomes, each teeming with new foes and mind-bending puzzles. Using your unique energy management abilities, collaborate with a friend in an online or classic split-screen environment.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/910cbe4eb606792c70f2eff2cfc9f9b6.poster.avif?t=1766494177\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/910cbe4eb606792c70f2eff2cfc9f9b6.webm?t=1766494177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/910cbe4eb606792c70f2eff2cfc9f9b6.mp4?t=1766494177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/a849241e4cd57aa5fd9fd7e1d70f7fe5.avif?t=1766494177\" width=616 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Co-op Gameplay:</strong> Players collaborate to achieve common goals and overcome challenges together. Join forces to charge and convert energy, powering machines and solving puzzles to progress through levels. Don't have someone by your side? No worries; single-player mode is available too!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Challenges:</strong> Compete against a range of digital foes and virus bots while navigating difficult puzzles that need seamless teamwork and strategy. Adapt your techniques to defeat each individual adversary.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/601ecb60877539e5f9c4c57cd75dee69.poster.avif?t=1766494177\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/601ecb60877539e5f9c4c57cd75dee69.webm?t=1766494177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/601ecb60877539e5f9c4c57cd75dee69.mp4?t=1766494177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/f0e4e3addba857e44af1f38d523a3be2.avif?t=1766494177\" width=616 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Biomes</strong> - Traverse through different computer components, from the neon-lit circuits of the motherboard to the intricate pathways of the CPU. Each biome brings its unique set of enemies and puzzle challenges, keeping you on your toes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Antivirus Special Forces</strong> - Engage on an operation unlike any other, where fast thinking and teamwork are critical to victory. You are not only a special unit... but also cute chubby droids!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Co-op Experience</strong> - Whether you prefer online play or classic split-screen, Bytebond offers a seamless experience with a controller support steering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/d3c283728145d98db57e6463e1598e54.poster.avif?t=1766494177\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/d3c283728145d98db57e6463e1598e54.webm?t=1766494177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/extras/d3c283728145d98db57e6463e1598e54.mp4?t=1766494177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["DVD Unicorns"],"dlc":[3621820,3883210,3907670],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952690/60db3c7b5aded3a88d9b6cfddc30eb363358c8ae/header.jpg?t=1766494177","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Big Sur 11<br></